{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "093545c17ddf95e801baa56e15a7067660ad09d676fda46c22a4d20d3fa6ea2c", "ja": "海美、ブログ読んだよ。\n新しい衣装、だいぶ気に入ってるみたいだな！", "zh": "海美，我看了你的部落格啰。\n看来你很喜欢新的服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
