{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "502fd27fbcbdb0c4ee3e0833b295b041c45fed8329f331df7639e11553bebaa7", "ja": "それ！　この衣装、私が、「衣装をもらえるなら、\nこういうのがいいなー」って思ってたとおりなの！", "zh": "就是说啊！这套服装就跟我\n心目中的理想服装一模一样耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "f758786613d410062d9a95b23197e9e9d9db2f65dbdf3762bdf0013b39de632b", "ja": "もしかして……{$P$}って、\n私のコトに超詳しい？　なんで！？", "zh": "该不会……其实{$P$}\n对我了若指掌吧？为什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ce61f33a392b723d7ae8a9cb5d7e0c60acc2c017467c2c5ee329a7b349b8b74e", "ja": "え、なんでって……。海美の事をいつも\n一番近くで見てる、プロデューサーだからかな？", "zh": "呃，你问为什么……应该是因为我总是\n在最近距离看着海美，是你的制作人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "f49cf03af572b78e7ade3e987c03c2e0a4e8ae5291eadb1fabc005011574f615", "ja": "……そっかー！　そうだよね、いつも私のコト、\n一番近くで見ててくれるんだもんね。えへへ……♪", "zh": "……这样啊──！说得也是，\n你总是在最近距离看着我。嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "ceba7458b5c7855750649f2976592003ee69af712574a762fb6a673b1e507815", "ja": "ありがとうっ、{$P$}！\n私、この衣装すごく気に入ったよ！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我非常喜欢这套服装喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
