{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "a0345abbb0a7cd68c4a7235b813091ff5662a14d979bcbeaf1c2d0257cc0892a", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　{$P$}、\nひとつお願いがあるんだけど、いいかな？", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}，\n我有件事情想拜托你，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "edd75d42bad236064e1b53c77650a3da3afe19e724b0cd34b4e8084f7a12add6", "ja": "なんだ？", "zh": "什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "613b3103e0a8a1ebaca274e2ad8720917c7f2005c6767edb4d9cbcaedfb8794c", "ja": "うん！　あのね、これからも、\nずっとずっとずーっと、私の衣装を選んでほしいっ！", "zh": "谢谢！是这样的，我希望你以后也可以\n一直一直一～直替我挑服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0054_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "ac177e44806e47d2add12672a3b40aafa78ad5726459f0596c4ae00835c135cf", "ja": "私、アイドルも女子力もまだまだ初心者だから……\n{$P$}がいないと、ダメだと思うっ。", "zh": "我不管在偶像还是女子力方面都是初学者……\n所以要是没有{$P$}，我就不行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
